---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import introPhoto from '../assets/images/intro-photo.png';
---
<section class="intro">
  <div class="container intro-grid">
    <div class="intro-art">
      <div class="photo-frame" style="aspect-ratio:4/5">
        <Image
          class="photo-frame-img"
          src={introPhoto}
          alt="Hume Edge team working session"
          widths={[330, 460]}
          sizes="(max-width: 660px) 100vw, 460px"
          quality={70}
          loading="lazy"
          style="object-fit:contain"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="intro-art-sticker" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="-14 -14 128 114" width="84" height="73" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet">
          <polygon points="25,0 75,0 100,43.3 75,86.6 25,86.6 0,43.3" fill="#00FB90" stroke="#00FB90" stroke-width="22" stroke-linejoin="round" />
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="intro-body">
      <div class="eyebrow">Built on global experience</div>
      <p class="lead" style="margin-top:24px">
        Too many AI programs stall at the same point: <em>the technology is ready, the people aren't.</em>
      </p>
      <p class="body">
        <a href="https://mnpdigital.ca/insights/2026-canadian-ai-report-download/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MNP's The Business of AI 2026 report</a> found that only 4% of organizations consider their use of AI to deliver transformational strategic value.
      </p>
      <p class="body">
        Most of the industry treats that gap as a footnote. We treat it as the headline. Our founding team has led transformation programs at the firms that defined the category. We left to build something the category was missing.
      </p>
      <p class="body">
        We've designed some of the world's largest transformations. We've seen what works. We've seen what doesn't. The discipline came with us. The bureaucracy didn't.
      </p>
      <p class="intro-tagline">
        An AI advisory firm that begins where others stop.<br />
        <em>The Human-Side of AI.</em>
      </p>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost-dark" href="/about">Learn More About Us</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
